{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1162615-could-this-npc-work","id":1162615,"title":"Could this NPC work?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-25T20:24:14-08:00","id":1162615,"title":"Could this NPC work?","content":"I might be getting W:TA 20th ed for Christmas and i am currently thinking up characters for it. One possible character for use in a Changing Breeds game is a recently-changed Bastet in New Orleans, Louisiana who is using his new abilities to go Frank Castle on the city's criminal underworld. The reason being that his First Change was caused by Haitian gangsters gunning down his family in a hit. Could this type of NPC work and what breed of Bastet would he be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T21:08:01-08:00","id":1162622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1162615-could-this-npc-work#post1162615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might be getting W:TA 20th ed for Christmas and i am currently thinking up characters for it. One possible character for use in a Changing Breeds game is a recently-changed Bastet in New Orleans, Louisiana who is using his new abilities to go Frank Castle on the city's criminal underworld. The reason being that his First Change was caused by Haitian gangsters gunning down his family in a hit. Could this type of NPC work and what breed of Bastet would he be?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> New Orleans is a pretty international city with all sorts of people from through out the world so.. any? I mean Khan, Balam, Simba are the big cats so they might be a better choice, Pumonca and Qualmi are relatively local.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-25T22:09:19-08:00","id":1162637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1162615-could-this-npc-work?p=1162622#post1162622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> New Orleans is a pretty international city with all sorts of people from through out the world so.. any? I mean Khan, Balam, Simba are the big cats so they might be a better choice, Pumonca and Qualmi are relatively local.</div> </div> </div> </div>Simba would make sense, considering their pride-like mentality when it comes to kin. So, i can actually see one going after the gangsters that killed it's family and liking killing criminals enough to continue it every night. Pumonca and Balam are also good choices. I wonder what kind of storylines a character like this could bring?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-29T21:49:49-08:00","id":1163821,"title":"","content":"I like the concept! If it were my character, I might lean more towards Richard Castle, but he's not as &quot;dark,&quot; so your guy should fit right into the CWoD. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-02T12:30:36-08:00","id":1164598,"title":"","content":"I think i might make the guy a werejagure. I like thi image of a Balam leaping from rooftop to rooftop stalking gangsters like prey in the jungle. I wonder how a Balam's kinfolk could end up in the Big Easy if they are so protective of them? I am also wondering how the rest of the werecreatures in the city will react to the Balam mowing through the city's criminal underworld?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12